Project Description:
To make the project more viable, the company has decided to expand the existing plant by expansion / installation of the following units: 

1.  Capacity enhancement of Cold Rolling MILL(CRM) #1 from 48,000 TPA to 1,75,000 TPA. 
2.  Installation of New CRM (#5) - Capacity of 2,40,000 TPA 
3.  Expansion of existing Pickling Line from 1,80,000 TPA to 4,50,000 TPA 
4.  Convertion of the existing Galvanized Line #1 & # 4 into Galvalume from capacity of 60,000 TPA to 1,55,000 TPA and from capacity of 54,000 TPA to 85,000 TPA respectively 
5.  Capacity enhancement of Aluminium Foil & Sheet Division (Coated & Laminated) from 20,004 TPA to 27,504 TPA. 

The overall production capacity of Finished Products are as follows: 

- Cold Rolling / GP/ GC Sheet & Coil (7,51,008 TPA); 
- Polyethylene Coated Pipe (1,00,800 TPA); 
- MS Pipe (99,996 TPA); 
- Aluminium Foil & Sheet (Coated & Laminated) (27,504 TPA); 
- Iron Oxide (1,200 TPA).
